<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Swedish consumer prices unchanged in July.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Swedish consumer prices unchanged in July.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish July consumer prices were unchanged from June, producing a year-on-year change of 1.0 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES    July 97    June 97    July 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	   0.0	+0.1	 -0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    +1.0	+0.8	 +0.7</p>
<p> Index (base 100=1980)	  257.3     257.4	256.3</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected July consumer prices to rise 0.1 percent for a year-on-year rise of 1.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
